# Tests

- Run the commands in [Tests](../../AGENTS.md#tests) before a pull request is ready.
- CI runs those same commands on every pull request and on every push to main, and checks the vendored demo kit hash.
- When a test fails, fix the project. Do not weaken a test to make it pass.
- A change to what a visitor sees needs an automated test that fails if that change is missing.
